==Trivia==
* '''Xi Lai''' is the romanized name of Chinese character '''禧来''', which means the embodiment of good wishes in Chinese.
* They are the first and only organization to qualify through a Net Café Tournament and win [[VCL/2024/Ascension/China|VCT Ascension]], that being [[China_National_Competition/Season_2/North_Division|CN Nationals S2 - North Division]].

